gajG(){return"Help"},
gajq(){return"Getting started guide"},
gaiI(){return"Mi Cafetal is the account book for your farm: you write down what you spend and what you sell, and the app does the math. In the end you know what really matters: whether your farm is making or losing money, and why."},
gak1(){return"What it is for"},
gak0(){return"To know whether you are making or losing money, how much each kilo you produce costs you, and how each crop and each month is doing. With those numbers you decide: what to plant, when to sell, where to cut costs."},
gaio(){return"What it does"},
gaim(){return"It adds up what you record \u2014expenses, plantings, sales and your workers' daily pay\u2014 and shows you the month, the year, the cash box, the cost per kilo and the kilos per hectare or per plant. It warns you when something is off and lets you export reports to PDF or Excel."},
gail(){return"Your data is yours"},
gaik(){return"It is stored on your phone and the app works without internet. Nothing is made up: if a figure is missing, it is left blank instead of being filled with a zero. You can back it up to a file or sync it to see it from another device."},
